m.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/167-nikink","name":"nikink","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"360"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T06:54:40-08:00","id":318920,"title":"","content":"It works on my laptop, and I'm running Ubuntu 12.04; I didn't even need to run it through Wine!<br /> <br /> I might have to write a program that formats the output a bit, though.<br /> <br /> EDIT:<br /> <br /> Sorry, I wanted to post one of my random Demons:<br /> <br /> <b>Incarnation</b>: Guardian<br /> <b>Form Components:</b> Electrical Sight, Spurs, Low Density, Clairvoyant Sight, Collapsible, Phasing, Insect Swarm<br /> <b>Form Appearance:</b> When Ms. Browser enters her Demonic Form, she collapses into a pile of semi-transparent spiders. On closer inspection, any given spider does not constantly exist; spiders are constantly popping in and out of existence in a burst of static, averaging out to continuous buzz. On even closer inspection, the spiders' eyes are actually staticky video screens, and their legs end in needles.<br /> <b>Embeds:</b> Freeze Assets, Play Possum, In My Pocket.<br /> <b>Exploit:</b> Disintegrate.<br /> <br /> I'd <i>happily</i> play Ms. Browser (short for Web Browser; any program that actually trawls the internet <i>is</i> called a web spider, after all.) I was kinda lucky in that all the Embeds and the Exploit do fall within the &quot;theme&quot; (Disintegrate's prerequisite is Freeze Assets, by the way.) I'd peg her as a Inquisitor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":1170,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","user":"amechra","date":". 11-22-2014, 10:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-22T15:35:21-08:00","id":319442,"title":"","content":"Ha! That's awesome. I'm amazed and pleased it runs on Ubuntu. Did not think it would. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And great demon. Love the description.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/ofii86boiyk38ng/DtDRandomForms.zip\" target=\"_blank\">Open the gates of Hell: Random Demon Generator.</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1X6qQzoAPrSRNzl3cQcMWasoPv3eK56sIlAOTeay61No/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Gather an army of Rage! Random Garou Generator.</a><br /> Shapeshifting Historian<br /> Writer - Werewolf: the Apocalypse, Werewolf: the Forsaken, Exalted 3e, TC: \u00c6on","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user